@startuml farmearAura-DC-v3
title Farmear aura - Colaboración v3 (farmeo repetido)
object ":Persona" as Persona
object ":Gesto" as Gesto
object ":Aura" as Aura
Persona -left--> Gesto : 1*: [sigue farmeando] hacer()
Gesto --> Gesto : 1.1: valorar()
Gesto -down--> Aura : 1.2a: [épico] otorgar(+n)\n1.2b: [cringe] restar(n)
Aura -right---> Persona : 1.3: darAura(total)
@enduml
